PracticeHarvest
├── labelFor
│   ├── given a name beside the price
│   │   ├── it reads the nearest one
│   │   ├── it reads it from an image when that is where it is written
│   │   └── it collapses the whitespace a page wrapped it in
│   ├── given the only name is far above the price
│   │   └── it gives up rather than reading the page itself
│   └── given no name anywhere
│       └── it reports none
└── harvestSeenPrices
    ├── given a named price
    │   ├── it keeps the label, the amount and the currency
    │   └── it keeps nothing else about it
    ├── given a price with no name beside it
    │   └── it drops it
    ├── given a span we never recorded an original for
    │   └── it drops it rather than reading back our own output
    ├── given an original that is not a price
    │   └── it drops it
    └── given a page with nothing converted
        └── it finds nothing
